@startuml DiagramaDeSequenciaAutenticacao

actor User
participant "API Gateway" as APIGW
participant "Authentication Service" as AuthSvc
participant "User Service" as UserSvc
participant "Database" as DB

User -> APIGW: POST /login
APIGW -> AuthSvc: Authenticate(credentials)
AuthSvc -> UserSvc: Validate User(credentials)
UserSvc -> DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = ?
DB --> UserSvc: Return User Data
UserSvc --> AuthSvc: Return Validation Result
AuthSvc -> AuthSvc: Generate Token
AuthSvc --> APIGW: Return Token
APIGW --> User: Return Token

@enduml